Package: tRexCAP
Title: 3D Whole Genome Chromosomal Structure Estimation From HiC Data
Version: 0.9.0
Description: The tREX-cap (Random effect EXpression-cut and paste) method uses
    a divide-and-conquer strategy to construct whole-genome 3D structures.
    The genome is first cut into pieces, and a 3D structure is built for
    each piece from its su-bcontact matrix using 'tREX'. These structures
    are then pasted together to form the whole-genome structure through
    the best structure-preserving isometric transformation.
